ADAPTIVE / HIG / a11y / units
  • One SwiftUI layer, adaptive macOS + iOS/iPadOS: ViewThatFits overview row, adaptive LazyVGrid
    gauge grid, size-class-free; .navigationBarTitleDisplayMode(.inline) on iOS only.
  • Materials via TSGlassPanel (.regularMaterial), tokens only (Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing /
    TSRadius) — no hardcoded colours/typography; light/dark + increased-contrast via tsDynamicColor.
  • a11y: header traits, .accessibilityElement(children:.contain/.combine/.ignore), gauge
    label+value, Dynamic Type (token fonts), Reduce-Motion-aware TSFadeIn/TSStagger.
  • SI honored: leaves fed SI (m, m/s, °C, W, N·m); display conversion at the render boundary only
    (DrivetrainSI + each leaf's own useUnits()-mirroring prefs). ADR-013 staleness chip (>2 min).

